  // supply, and reports "couldn't sign in" separately from "couldn't reach" —
  // so an unvetted host turns the wizard into a port scanner and an SSH
  // credential-stuffer aimed at 10.20.0.0/24, which is every other customer's
  // VPS, and at the hypervisor itself. `createMigration` hands the same host to
